|YKB'To worship gold is folly; a Monk troubles themselves not with
such things.'|WKO - |RKBMaster Oronus|WKO

|YKOA Monk shall hold no earthly possessions, and it is expected
that a Monk donates their money to the abbey. Possessing too
much money distracts a Monk, and having a large bank balance
is distracting. Your tithes shall be recorded, and one who
has donated more is generally more favoured.

